{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001545","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001545"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001545","label":"石碏（衛諫臣）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"石碏","mention_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0092","c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0114","c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0135","c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0037"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0092","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p010","quote":"石碏"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0114","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p011","quote":"石碏"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0135","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p011","quote":"石碏"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p054","quote":"石碏"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m011-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m054-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001545","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p054","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji037-062","person_id":"cbr-p001545","surfaces":["石碏"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p010","quote":"莊公五年，取齊女爲夫人，好而無子。又取陳女爲夫人，生子，蚤死。陳女女弟亦幸於莊公，而生子完。完母死，莊公令夫人齊女子之，立爲太子。莊公有寵妾，生子州吁。十八年，州吁長，好兵，莊公使將。石碏諫莊公曰：「庶子好兵，使將，亂自此起。」不聽。二十三年，莊公卒，太子完立，是爲桓公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p011","quote":"桓公二年，弟州吁驕奢，桓公絀之，州吁出奔。十三年，鄭伯弟段攻其兄，不勝，亡，而州吁求與之友。十六年，州吁收聚衞亡人以襲殺桓公，州吁自立爲衞君。爲鄭伯弟段欲伐鄭，請宋、陳、蔡與倶，三國皆許州吁。州吁新立，好兵，弒桓公，衞人皆不愛。石碏乃因桓公母家於陳，詳爲善州吁。至鄭郊，石碏與陳侯共謀，使右宰丑進食，因殺州吁于濮，而迎桓公弟晉於邢而立之，是爲宣公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p054","quote":"司寇受封，梓材有作。成錫厥器，夷加其爵。暨武能脩，從文始約。詩美歸燕，傳矜石碏。皮冠射鴻，乘軒使穀。宣縱淫嬖，釁生伋、朔。蒯聵得罪，出公行惡。衞祚日衰，失於君角。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p010","text":"莊公五年，取齊女爲夫人，好而無子。又取陳女爲夫人，生子，蚤死。陳女女弟亦幸於莊公，而生子完。完母死，莊公令夫人齊女子之，立爲太子。莊公有寵妾，生子州吁。十八年，州吁長，好兵，莊公使將。石碏諫莊公曰：「庶子好兵，使將，亂自此起。」不聽。二十三年，莊公卒，太子完立，是爲桓公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001541","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001542","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"夫人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"陳女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001543","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"夫人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m010-0025","start":25,"end":30,"surface":"生子，蚤死","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"